    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joshua kughora na wandu aho Shekemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Joshua ukakwanya vichuku vose va Israeli aho Shekemu. Ukawiwanga waghosi na vilongozi, watanyi na wabaa wa Israeli; nawo wikacha imbiri ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukawizera wandu wose, “BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba huwu, ‘Kala weke ndeyo Tera, ndee Abrahamu na Nahori werekoghe wikikaia kimonu cha Moda ghwa Eufrate na kutasa milungu mizima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 11.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngamsaghua ndeyo Abrahamu kufuma kwa ijo isanga, ngamruwusa kimonu cha Moda ghwa Eufrate na kumghenja aghadi ya isanga jose ja Kanaani, na kumneka kivalwa kingi. Ngamneka Isaaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.1+GEN.12.2+GEN.12.3+GEN.12.4+GEN.12.5+GEN.12.6+GEN.12.7+GEN.12.8+GEN.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 12.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.1+GEN.21.2+GEN.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kwa Isaaka ngamneka Jakobo na Esau. Niko ngamneka Esau na isanga ja mighondinyi ja Seiri jikaie ifwa jake, ela Jakobo na wana wake wikasea cha Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.24+GEN.25.25+GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 25.24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.1+GEN.46.2+GEN.46.3+GEN.46.4+GEN.46.5+GEN.46.6+GEN.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngawiduma Musa na Haruni, ngawikaba Wamisri kwa agho nereghibonyereghe aghadi kwawo, konyuma ngamfunya aho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kuf. 3.1–12.42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngawifunya weke ndeyo Misri wikacha hata baharinyi, na Wamisri wikawinugha na magare ghawo hata Bahari ya Shamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.1+EXO.14.2+EXO.14.3+EXO.14.4+EXO.14.5+EXO.14.6+EXO.14.7+EXO.14.8+EXO.14.9+EXO.14.10+EXO.14.11+EXO.14.12+EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14+EXO.14.15+EXO.14.16+EXO.14.17+EXO.14.18+EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29+EXO.14.30+EXO.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 14.1-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wanikemia ngangira kira ghadi na ghadi yawo na Wamisri, ngaibonya bahari iwimile Wamisri na kuwifinikira; meso ghawo ghikawona seji nawibonya Wamisri; nenyo mkakaia kireti kwa ngelo ndacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngamreda kwa isanga ja Waamori awo werekoghe mashariki ya Jordani. Wikalwa nenyo, ela ngawingira mikonunyi konyu, mkajiwusa isanga jawo, nani ngawitotesha imbiri konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Balaki mwana wa Sipori mzuri wa Moabu ukawuka kulwa na Israeli, ukaduma kummbanga Balaamu mwana wa Beori upate kummbwasira njowe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mit. 22.1–24.25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela ngalegha kumsikira Balaamu; kwa huwo ukamrasimia inyo, nani ngamkira kufuma kwa Balaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkaruwuka Jordani mkacha Jeriko; wandu wa Jeriko wikalwa nenyo, na wokoni Waamori, Waperizi, Wakanaani, Wahiti, Wagirgashi, Wahivi na Wajebusi; nawo ngawingira mikonunyi konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.4.14+JOS.4.15+JOS.4.16+JOS.4.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jos. 4.14-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.1+JOS.6.2+JOS.6.3+JOS.6.4+JOS.6.5+JOS.6.6+JOS.6.7+JOS.6.8+JOS.6.9+JOS.6.10+JOS.6.11+JOS.6.12+JOS.6.13+JOS.6.14+JOS.6.15+JOS.6.16+JOS.6.17+JOS.6.18+JOS.6.19+JOS.6.20+JOS.6.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.1-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwa wazuri wawi wa Waamori, nerewidumieghe ngalamvu kuwisumbua rikawiwinga imbiri konyu; hata ndewerefumieghe kwa wundu ghwa inyo kutumia lufu angu ndana anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 23.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 7.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neremnekieghe isanga mserejidumikieghe, na mizi msereiaghieghe; nenyo mwadakaia aho. Mwadaaja matunda gha mizabibu na gha mizeituni msereiwaeghe.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.10+DEU.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 6.10-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukachuria kughora, “Idana mumneke ishima na kumdumikia BWANA kwa ngolo na kwa wuloli, muinje nambai milungu ya weke ndeyo wereidumikieghe aho Mesopotamia na Misri, mpate kumdumikia BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ikakaia mwalegha kumdumikia, msaghuo idime iji ngera ni milungu iyo eredumikiloghe ni weke ndeyo aho Mesopotamia angu ngera ni milungu ya Waamori awo mwawuyakaia isanga jawo; ela ini na nyumba yapo nichamdumikia BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko awo wandu wikamtumbulia, “Jingi ndedichaamsigha BWANA wei diidumikie milungu mizima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia BWANA Mlungu odu nuo oredifunyireghe isi na weke aba kufuma isanga ja Misri, iyo nyumba ya wazumba; nao nuo orebonyereghe rija alama mbaa imbiri ya meso ghedu, ukadilindia chia yose derekoghe dikighenda, na aghadi ya wandu wose derekoghe dikiwiida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na BWANA ukawiwinga wandu wose imbiri kodu awo Waamori werekoghe wikikaia aha. Kwa huwo isi wori dichamdumikia BWANA, angu uo ni Mlungu odu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukawizera awo wandu, “Mwadima kulemwa ni kumdumikia BWANA, kwa kukaia uo ni Mlungu Mweli, Mlungu ukunde kutaswa uekeri, nao ndechaamfuya wughoma makosa na kaung'a renyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkamsigha BWANA na kudumikia milungu mizima, uchamghaluka na kum'bonya kiwiwi, na kummeria, hata ngera orekoghe uki'bonyera nicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo wandu wikamzera Joshua, “Hata! Isi dichamdumikia BWANA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukawizera, “Mwakushuhudia mmbeni kukaia mwasaghua BWANA mpate kumdumikia.” Wikamtumbulia, “Isi de washahidi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawizera, “Basi injenyi milungu yenyu ya kighenyi iko aghadi konyu, na kukufunya kwa BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli kwa ngolo renyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo wandu wikamzera Joshua, “Dichamdumikia BWANA Mlungu odu, na kumsikira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Joshua ukabonya ilaghano na awo wandu ituku ijo, ukawika sharia na malaghiro aighu yawo uko Shekemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukaandika agho malagho andenyi ya chuo cha Sharia ya Mlungu, ukashoa igho ibaa, ukajidunga kimusi aisi ya mualoni ghuko andu kwa wueli kwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukawizera wandu wose, “Olenyi iji igho jichawuya mshahidi aighu yedu, angu jasikira malagho ghose BWANA wadizera. Kwa huwo jichakaia mshahidi aighu yenyu eri msechemlegha Mlungu onyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukawisigha wandu wighende kula mundu andu kwa ifwa jake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kufwa kwa Joshua na Eleazari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya agho, Joshua mwana wa Nuni, mdumiki wa BWANA ukafwa, uko na miaka ighana na ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wikamrika mbuwenyi ya ifwa jake aho Timnathi-sera, iko isanga ja mighondinyi ja Efraimu, kaskazinyi ya Mghondi ghwa Gaashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wikamdumikia BWANA matuku ghose gha Joshua, na gha waghosi awo werekwanyeghe na Joshua, awo wose wererimanyireghe iro kazi BWANA orebonyereghe kwa Waisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu uo orefueghe Misri, wandu wa Israeli weremdwaeghe na kumrika aho Shekemu; andenyi ya mbuwa iyo Jakobo oreighueghe kufuma kwa wana wa Hamori ndee wawo Shekemu kwa bei ya vibelele va feza ighana, nayo ikawuya ifwa ja kivalwa cha Josefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
